{"version":1,"content":"<p>中午12時43分，石鼓洲旁人工島綜合廢物管理設施第一期發生火警，於下午1時24分升為三級，消防員共動用5條喉及5隊煙帽隊灌救。</p><p>火勢於下午4時45大致被救熄。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:29.504790+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:49:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.864252+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:05.450337+00:00","content_hash":"0e56f9d259dcdd4699435d08dce32badf690ad9ad99e1468cd3152eb376a2e89","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}